  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary Assisted Return Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme supports migrants willing to return voluntarily to their countries of origin (CoOs) and contributes to improve return migration management in Norway. It will be based on the already existing Voluntary Assisted Return Programme framework and complementary activities offered. The programme is open to international protection applicants, to applicants whose international protection request was rejected, migrants in an irregular situation in Norway and to migrants with a legal residency in Norway who want to return voluntary to their CoOs.</narrative>
  </description>
